——如何避免AI'一本正经地胡说八道'</title><link>https://rexai.top/prompt-engineering/08-biyingshuoleaijiubuhuanluanle/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rexai.top/prompt-engineering/08-biyingshuoleaijiubuhuanluanle/</guid><description>AI有时候会自信满满地给你一个完全错误的答案。今天就聊聊几个简单有效的招数，让AI不再&amp;#39;一本正经地胡说八道&amp;#39;。</description></item><item><title>让Claude逐步思考，AI就不瞎猜了</title><link>https://rexai.top/prompt-engineering/06-rangclaude%E9%80%90%E6%AD%A5%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83ai%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E7%9E%8E%E7%8C%9C%E4%BA%86/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rexai.top/prompt-engineering/06-rangclaude%E9%80%90%E6%AD%A5%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83ai%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E7%9E%8E%E7%8C%9C%E4%BA%86/</guid><description>有没有发现AI有时候会傻乎乎地答错问题？其实只要让AI&amp;#39;出声思考&amp;#39;，准确率立马提升。今天聊聊这个简单又好用的技巧。</description></item></channel></rss>